[[File:Keelboat-TMCh8.png|thumb|250px|A keelboat]]
A '''Keelboat''' was a type of [[boat]] used to [[transport]] individuals. A special type of keelboat was able to transport individuals across the [[Magma|lava]] rivers of the [[lava fields]]<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|keelboat|keelboat}}</ref> on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]]<ref name="TSWB">''[[The Star Wars Book]]''</ref> [[Nevarro]].<ref name="Databank" /> In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|8|the appearance of the keelboat}}</ref> one such boat was operated by [[MA-13]] who helped [[Din Djarin]], [[Carasynthia Dune|Cara Dune]], [[Greef Karga]], and [[IG-11]] [[Clash on Nevarro|rescue]] [[Din Grogu|the Child]] from [[Gideon's Imperial remnant|Imperial]] pursuers.<ref name="Chapter 8">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 8: Redemption}}</ref>

